          .founderCard__content
            h6.subtitle.founderCard__role._anim-items._anim-no-hide Founder & CEO
            h2.h2.founderCard__name._anim-items._anim-no-hide Yurii Kapkov
            p.text_2.founderCard__story._anim-items._anim-no-hide
              | I grew up in Ukraine — a place that shaped my resilience early on. Wrote my first lines of code at 15, graduated top of my faculty in Software Engineering with a 96/100 GPA, won sport programming championships. From day one at university, I was already shipping freelance projects every evening.
            p.text_2.founderCard__story._anim-items._anim-no-hide
              | Over the years I went from developer to Software Architect to CTO. Personally led and launched over 20 startups and enterprise products — some solo, some with teams. From greenfield architecture to production at scale.
            p.text_2.founderCard__story._anim-items._anim-no-hide
              | I've lived in nearly 20 countries. Now I split my time between Israel and the US. ApolloRise is my life's work. Every wall I hit, I climb over. Every limit, I push through. I believe authentic hard work always wins.
